course: dictionary
lesson: 9867
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning. Syrup is one of them. Its first meaning is a thick, sweet, sticky liquid made from sugar and water, or from plants. Its second meaning is a liquid medicine that tastes sweet.
explain: «Pour the maple syrup over your pancakes.» The clues are pancakes and pour, so syrup must be the sticky food. «Take one spoon of cough syrup before bed.» The clues are cough and spoon, so syrup must be medicine.
explain: To choose the right meaning, read the words around the word. Then swap your meaning into the sentence. If the food meaning fits pancakes and the medicine meaning does not, you have found the right one.
fact: Syrup is a thick, sweet, sticky liquid.
fact: Syrup can be made from sugar and water, or from plants.
fact: Maple syrup and golden syrup are two kinds of syrup.
fact: «Cough syrup» is a sweet liquid medicine.
fact: «A lollipop is sugar syrup boiled until almost all the water is gone, so it sets hard.»
exercise: «Pour a spoon of golden syrup over the porridge.» What does syrup mean here? | A hard, glassy sweet | A small glass bottle | *A thick, sweet, sticky liquid | A liquid medicine that tastes sweet
exercise: «Mum gave me a spoon of cough syrup, and it tasted sweet.» What does syrup mean here? | *A liquid medicine that tastes sweet | A kind of bird | A bottle of fizzy lemonade | A thick, sweet, sticky liquid on food
exercise: «A lollipop is sugar syrup boiled until almost all the water is gone.» What happens to the water? | *It is boiled away | It is poured on top | It is frozen into ice | It turns into syrup and stays
test: «Treacle is thick sweet syrup, like golden syrup or molasses.» What is treacle, according to the sentence? | *Thick sweet syrup | A kind of bird | A cough medicine | A bottle of lemonade
test: «Diabolo fraise is a fizzy lemonade with strawberry syrup.» What flavour is diabolo fraise? | *Strawberry | Red grenadine | Mint | Lemon
exam: The nurse says, «Take this syrup for your sore throat.» Which meaning of syrup fits? | A sort of cake | A small bottle with a lid | A thick, sweet, sticky liquid from sugar | *A liquid medicine that tastes sweet
